# Pairs with LivePublisherPinned. The classifier stops reading the tree id
# (issue #3105's diagnostic half reversed the wrong way): every row reads as a
# husk, so a live leaf's pin is retired.
MODULE: LivePublisherPinnedReadIgnoresTreeId
TARGET: LivePublisherPinned
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: every leaf read is classified as a husk
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
    /\ verdict' = [verdict EXCEPT ![p] = IF phase = "husk" THEN "husk" ELSE "live"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the tree id is not consulted.
    /\ verdict' = [verdict EXCEPT ![p] = "husk"]
--- END
